  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity UNICEF Children &amp; AIDS Regional Initiative (CARI) - Memo. of Understanding. is a component of UNICEF Children and AIDS Regional Initiative (CARI) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;23,688,318. This project benefits South of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Social Protection, STD control including HIV/AIDS.</narrative>
